## PowerShell — VS Dark+ syntax highlighting (Smax)
syntax powershell "\.ps(m|d)?1$"
comment "#"

## Cmdlets  Verb-Noun
color #dda "\<[A-Z][a-zA-Z]+-[A-Z][a-zA-Z]+\>"

## Method / property access  .Name
color #dda "\.[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*"

## Declarations / keywords
icolor #59c "\<(function|filter|workflow|configuration|class|enum|param|begin|process|end|dynamicparam|using|namespace|module|static|hidden)\>"

## Control flow
icolor #c8c "\<(if|elseif|else|switch|foreach|for|while|do|until|try|catch|finally|trap|in|return|break|continue|throw|exit)\>"

## Comparison / logical operators  -eq -like -match ...
icolor #59c "[[:space:]]-(eq|ne|gt|ge|lt|le|like|notlike|match|notmatch|contains|notcontains|in|notin|is|isnot|and|or|not|xor|band|bor|bxor|bnot|shl|shr|join|split|replace|f|as)\>"

## Type accelerators  [string] [int] [System.IO.File]
color #4cb "\[[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_.]*\]"

## Numbers (with optional KB/MB/GB/TB suffix)
color #bca "\<([0-9]+\.?[0-9]*([eE][-+]?[0-9]+)?)([kKmMgGtT][bB])?\>"

## Scoped variables  $env:PATH  $script:foo
color #9df "\$(global|script|local|private|env|using|workflow):[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*"
## Variables  $var  ${var}  $_ $? $^
color #9df "\$([A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*|\{[^}]*\}|[$?^_])"

## Strings (double-quoted with backtick escape, and single-quoted)
color #c97 ""([^"]|`.)*"|'[^']*'"

## Comments
color #6a5 "(^|[[:blank:]])#.*"
color #6a5 start="<#" end="#>"
